[E0314] Error: `str` cannot be a variable Wip reads from C
    ╭─[ err/130_c_globals/main.wip:12:15 ]
    │
 12 │     var name: str
    │               ─┬─  
    │                ╰─── not a value C hands over
    │ 
    │ Note: a variable is read as a copy of what C holds, so it is one of the scalars, a `cstring` or a `ptr<T>`
────╯
[E0314] Error: `[i32; 4]` cannot be a variable Wip reads from C
    ╭─[ err/130_c_globals/main.wip:13:16 ]
    │
 13 │     var slots: [c_int; 4]
    │                ─────┬────  
    │                     ╰────── not a value C hands over
    │ 
