[E0304] Error: cannot assign to `ceiling`, which C owns and Wip only reads
    ╭─[ err/130_c_globals/main.wip:19:5 ]
    │
 10 │     val ceiling: c_int
    │         ───┬───  
    │            ╰───── declared here
    │ 
 19 │     ceiling = 2 as c_int
    │     ───┬───  
    │        ╰───── declared `val`
    │ 
    │ Help: a variable Wip writes is declared `var`
    │ 
    │ Note: `val` in an extern block reads what C holds; `var` writes it as well
────╯
[E0412] Error: `&var` needs a variable, field or element
    ╭─[ err/130_c_globals/main.wip:20:15 ]
    │
 11 │     var counter: c_int
    │         ───┬───  
    │            ╰───── declared here
    │ 
 20 │     bump(&var counter)
    │               ───┬───  
    │                  ╰───── not a variable, field or element
    │ 
    │ Note: `counter` is C's variable, read as a copy of what C holds, so Wip has no address for it; pass the copy, or write it back with `counter = …`
────╯
